--
^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
A class whose only user-declared constructor is a template was taken for
an aggregate when a braced-init-list initialized a reference to it, so its
copy constructor was viable for `holder h({true, 4})' and was chosen ("no
match for holder" with arguments bool, int).  This is the shape of
`return {{b, e}};' for an optional<chk> with a converting constructor
template.
